### Petición 1: Obtener usuarios (GET)
GET http://localhost:3002/tickets HTTP/1.1


### Petición 2: Crear un nuevo usuario (POST)
POST http://localhost:3002/tickets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "1767687687",
  "description": "juan@example.com"
}

### Petición 3: Actualizar un ticket (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3002/tickets/cbef9d6e-c4d3-4641-afaf-c5b677f8f21e HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nuevo título",
  "description": "Nuhshshshhshhs",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Petición 4: Eliminar un ticket (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:3002/tickets/bbef9d6e-c4d3-4641-afaf-c5b677f8f21e HTTP/1.1
